%% Diagrama de Fluxo de Dados — Exemplo: processamento de tarefa
flowchart TD
  TaskQueue[Task Queue (fila/)]
  Kernel[Kernel\nDecision Engine]
  DriverAdapter[DriverNERVAdapter]
  BrowserPool[Browser Pool]
  Browser[Chromium Instance]
  Execute[Executa ação no browser]
  ResponseStore[Response Store (respostas/)]
  Server[Server Socket.io]
  Forensics[Forensics / Logging]

  TaskQueue --> Kernel
  Kernel --> DriverAdapter
  DriverAdapter --> BrowserPool
  BrowserPool --> Browser
  Browser --> Execute
  Execute --> ResponseStore
  ResponseStore --> Server
  DriverAdapter --> Forensics
  Kernel --> Forensics
